{"availability":"available","full":"sh1nj1/plan42","name":"plan42","description":"Workspace for humans and AI agents. Every block is a doc, a task, a discussion, and agent context — one object, not three copies your agent has to choose between. Context is lexically scoped: pin a rule at the root, every task below inherits it. Self-hosted, MCP-native.","category":"Productivity","language":"Ruby","stars":12,"forks":2,"created":"2025-05-22T08:56:15Z","updated":"2026-10-11T05:11:07Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://collavre.com","topics":["agent-context","ai-agents","collaboration","hierarchical","knowledge-base","llm","mcp","notion-alternative","project-management","rails","ruby","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://collavre.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.403Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.403Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.403Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.403Z","stars":12,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["One living tree for docs, tasks, discussions, and AI agent context.","Today those are three copies you keep in sync by hand, plus an agent wired to all of them that still has to guess which one is true. A block in Collavre is all four at once — one object. Pin a rule at the root and every task below it inherits it, for people and agents alike.","Live demo · Watch the 90-second demo · Features · AGPL-3.0"],"features":["Retrieval answers \"what matches this query.\" Inheritance answers \"what is always true here.\" The hard part was never reaching the data — it is knowing the boundary of the task. An agent over a flat store re-guesses that…","Connectors reconstruct at read time the relationships that were destroyed at write time. When you retyped the spec into a ticket, the link between them was never written down. No amount of retrieval recovers a link that…","A flat store has nothing to inherit. That is the part a connector cannot add from the outside."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sh1nj1/plan42/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"16e1c6e0196a0db4d1f24bdbd7cc656555ee8dfd601ec1b25bec8eac4b1bfe4e","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.472Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.472Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"One living tree for docs, tasks, discussions, and AI agent context.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sh1nj1/plan42/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in as admin@example.com / password123 — set DEFAULTUSEREMAIL and DEFAULTUSERPASSWORD before the first run to override.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sh1nj1/plan42/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"16e1c6e0196a0db4d1f24bdbd7cc656555ee8dfd601ec1b25bec8eac4b1bfe4e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sh1nj1/plan42/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.472Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T05:11:07Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sh1nj1/plan42/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.473Z","hash":"16e1c6e0196a0db4d1f24bdbd7cc656555ee8dfd601ec1b25bec8eac4b1bfe4e","originalBytes":7209,"storedBytes":7209,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["tree","agent","block","docs","mcp","one","bin","collavre","every","over","server","task","deploy","depth","never","rails","system","test","them","three","what","any","before","context","structure","tests","between","boundary","chat","chrome","context.","default","dev","document","driver","engine","heading","how","import","install","license","link","markdown","mcp-configuration.md","nothing","run","still","store","subtree","unit","write","agents","already","always","answers","aws","back","bash","block.","chromedriver","code","copies","demo","development","disabled","doc","does","down","each","engines","features","fenced","flat","guess","hand","headless","inherits","it.","keywords","leaf","lexical","manager","markdown-first.","mise","mi